     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div>Thanks to Melanie Foell who told me that NA in the spectra data might cause this problem. However, using the following command does not work:</div><div><br></div><div><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#660\">&gt;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> iData</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">data</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[[</span><span style=\"color:#066\">3</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]])[][</span><span style=\"color:#008\">is</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">na</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">iData</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">data</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[[</span><span style=\"color:#066\">3</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]])[])]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">0</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#606\">Error</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">in</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> setMatrix</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">x</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> value</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> failed to write data elementsEnter code here</span><span style=\"color:#660\">...</span></div></code></div><br>this for loop does not work either:</div><div><br></div><div><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#008\">for</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">i </span><span style=\"color:#008\">in</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> seq</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">dim</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">iData</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">data</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[[</span><span style=\"color:#066\">3</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]]))[</span><span style=\"color:#066\">2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]))</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">{</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  </span><span style=\"color:#008\">if</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">sum</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#008\">is</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">na</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">iData</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">data</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[[</span><span style=\"color:#066\">3</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]])[][,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">i</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]))</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&gt;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">0</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">{</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    cat</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">i</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;contains:&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> sum</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#008\">is</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">na</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">iData</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">data</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[[</span><span style=\"color:#066\">3</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]])[][,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">i</span><span style=\"color:#660\">])),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;NAs&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;\\n&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    replace</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">iData</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">data</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[[</span><span style=\"color:#066\">3</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]])[][,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">i</span><span style=\"color:#660\">],</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">is</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">na</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">iData</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">data</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[[</span><span style=\"color:#066\">3</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]])[][,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">i</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">0</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    cat</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">i</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;Replaced has now:&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> sum</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#008\">is</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">na</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">iData</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">data</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[[</span><span style=\"color:#066\">3</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]])[][,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">i</span><span style=\"color:#660\">])),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;NAs&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;\\n&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  </span><span style=\"color:#660\">}</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">}</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br></span><span style=\"color:#066\">735</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> contains</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">128</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">NAs</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br></span><span style=\"color:#066\">735</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Replaced</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> has now</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">128</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">NAs</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br></span><span style=\"color:#066\">736</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> contains</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">229</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">NAs</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br></span><span style=\"color:#066\">736</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Replaced</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> has now</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">229</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">NAs</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br></span><span style=\"color:#066\">737</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> contains</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">190</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">NAs</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br></span><span style=\"color:#066\">737</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Replaced</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> has now</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">190</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">NAs</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span></div></code></div><br></div><div><font size=\"2\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif\">Finally, even if that would work, the data[[3]] is not changed. Therefore, subsequent normalize() on data[[3]] will also not work (even if NAs have been deleted in before in the <span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif\"><code><span style=\"color:#000\"></span></code></span></span></font><code><span style=\"color:#000\"><font size=\"2\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif\">iData(data[[3]]). Or is data[[3]] automatically changed when iData(data[[3]]) will be changed?</span></font><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\"></span><span style=\"color:#660\"></span></code></div></div>"
    ]
   ]
